```

Prefer:

```text
CSD_FAILED
```

over:

```text
continued as if CSD succeeded
```

Prefer:

```text
INSUFFICIENT_SUPPORT
```

over:

```text
unstable Jacobian
```

The ingest contract should make invalid states visible to downstream analysis.

